OL,3,GNEWSAMan cleared of assaults after fall
OL,4,Afrom football stand
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyan could be seen crying in the dock
OL,7,Fas the jury returned verdicts of not
OL,8,Fguilty to both charges and said
OL,9,Fafterwards "it's been very stressful".
